/Title (Day 7 focused on establishing scalable frontend architecture and improving development workflow quality. React Context API was implemented to standardize global state management across the project, while ESLint was integrated to enforce coding standards and detect potential issues automatically. These enhancements improve maintainability, collaboration, and code quality for future development activities.)
